ough three chapters and meet three people. It takes about 40 minutes to reach the end. Next Fest runs until Oct 26, 10 AM PT (Oct 27, 02:00 KST). If it stays with you after you play, we'd love a spot on your wishlist. ▶ https://store.steampowered.com","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T08:29:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041434","verified_at":"2026-10-25T09:17:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4552590-1845383656392197","game_id":"steam-4552590","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update — A New Chapter Opens, and You Meet a Second Character","summary":"A new chapter has been added to the free demo of 〈Was Silence〉. Beyond the first story, the path Ian walks stretches one step further. With every step the world opens a little wider, and along that path, you meet a second character. At the end of that road, where story still waits unreached, we meet again as the complete demo at Steam Next Fest, October 2026. Follow along — with your wishlist — as this story is reclaimed one chapter at a time. English and Japanese will be added in the next updat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T23:00:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656392197","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4552590-1844115010501263","game_id":"steam-4552590","kind":"announcement","title":"Free Demo, Out Now — A Story That Begins in Silence","summary":"Was Silence's free demo is out now on Steam.This demo lets you play the story's first two chapters, for free.And this demo begins in silence. Today opens in complete silence, and afterward new chapters and sound effects, then music (BGM), will be added one by one as updates — until it returns as the complete, sound-restored demo at Steam Next Fest this October 2026.Follow along as a world without sound reclaims its sound, one step at a time, and its story, one chapter at a time — wishlist to sta","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-21T12:42:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010501263","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4552590-1842846814440173","game_id":"steam-4552590","kind":"announcement","title":"Was Silence — What Remains When the Sound Fades","summary":"Hello. This is Was Silence, by PWOK.Ian, a guitarist whose world is going quiet, meets others who have each lost a single sense — a 2D exploration visual novel that walks between silence and sound.We'll be quietly sharing the world and our progress here and on social from now on.Add it to your wishlist to hear the news first. A free demo is coming this fall.▶ Wishlist: https://store.steampowered.com/app/4552590","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T12:35:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814440173","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:50:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4552590":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:35Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:35Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4552590":"2026-10-26T12:52:35Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4552590":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:35Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:35Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:35Z"},"4667350":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:35Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:52:35Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-